Error [jet.ReactiveLambdaParameters]: `reactive.autorun` needs a zero-parameter lambda, got 1 parameter
  --> tests/ui/reactive_effect_takes_params.jet:5:22
    |
  5 |     reactive.autorun(fn(n: Int) {
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The body takes no arguments — it reads the signals it depends on via `.get()`
 Fix: Write `reactive.autorun(fn() { … })` with no parameters
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2911
